    "title": "FREE LIVE DRAG RACING: The Octoberbucks 150 - Saturday $15K at Numidia Dragway - Saturday September 26th, 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chad Reynolds ,\n21 hours ago It’s time for more big money bracket racing, and although $15,000 seems small in comparison to the OG Million that is going on this weekend, $15,000 is real money. Which is why, the Octoberbucks 150 from Numidia is still a great race. Thanks to their great staff, we’ve got the livestream to share from this weekend’s race. And although Numidia is a little track in the middle of Pennsylvania, it has garnered a lot of attention over the last few years with several big money races being put on there each year. It’s on my list of must attend tracks for 2027, so we’ll see. Read full article",
